    "summary": "Fresh Astra single-pass visual reading of all 26 prepared theory pages, with 4 shared exact-hash reference pages read once in the observational manifest. English originals (not Russian) confirm all 9 Bulgarian whole problems and their group ownership. All 9 existing IDs and Bulgarian wording retained; all supplied English sketches and complete basic criteria restored in native sections. Reference tables are native text. Three standalone rubric PNGs visually match the corresponding PDF pages. Source printed part-point sums exclude common points (RadioAstron 1.5, middayXVIII 2, SNR 2). Question 3 and 6 consist of native parts without opening prose. Full year inventory includes proceedings; that unneeded omnibus was inventoried, not read. Crop inspection is recorded separately in final evidence.",
    "sourceGaps": [
      "The supplied English solutions are explicitly sketches, not full worked explanations; the complete available sketches and grading criteria are transcribed.",
      "Printed key discrepancies are retained and explained: XIX subscript for the XVIII-century problem; arshin-distance exponent; equation-of-time longitude threshold; repeated rho notation and rounded SNR radius; sigma versus delta in the neutron-star distance.",
      "The alternative apparent-magnitude formula prints a plus sign before 5 lg p; retained as supplied.",
      "RadioAstron key prints b squared on the left of a square-root expression and inconsistent angular-conversion exponents; its stated 45 microarcsecond answer is retained.",
      "Bulgarian Cas A question prints 3400 km; original English question and key use 3400 pc. Both retained explicitly.",
      "No Bulgarian-language official key was found in the full year inventory. Official English sketches and criteria retained without invented translation or derivation."
    ],
    "cropInspectionHistory": "Every final actual crop opened and personally visually inspected in this batch, including duplicate map placements. All used --no-snap. No crop revisions. Complete chart borders, north arrows, scales, labels and source diagrams retained.",
    "sharedReading": "Four reference pages (constants.pdf pages1–3 and hrd.pdf page1) read once under the observational manifest and bound to identical document and PNG hashes in both manifests. All remaining pages freshly read. Total32unique original pages,36manifest page entries. Prior Astra English transcriptions reused only after this fresh source reading and comparison; no separate checker.",
